OL,3,GNEWSAMissed appointments and late
OL,4,Abills: people peeved at their postal
OL,5,Aservice
OL,6,
OL,7,FAndrew Whitaker says being able to rely
OL,8,Fon his post being delivered is
OL,9,Fessential.
OL,11,FThe Harrogate resident, who is
OL,12,Freceiving NHS support for issues with
OL,13,Fhis mental health, explains that
OL,14,Fmissing or late post can be the
OL,15,Fdifference between knowing about an
OL,16,Fappointment or finding himself at the
OL,17,Fback of the queue.
OL,19,FHe says "ongoing" delivery delays in
OL,20,Fhis area have caused issues.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
