OL,3,GNEWSAMissed appointments and late
OL,4,Abills: people peeved at their postal
OL,5,Aservice
OL,6,
OL,7,F"I've had a couple of appointments run
OL,8,Flate. Thankfully they've been OK about
OL,9,Fit. If you miss so many appointments
OL,10,Fyou get put back on the waiting list,
OL,11,For get taken off the list, which means
OL,12,Fyou have to re-refer."
